              "structuredContent": {
                "stdout": "1.\ntitle       Execute SSH Commands Without Sharing Server Access | CommandGuard\nhref        https://commandguard.app/\nbody        Allow users to execute SSH Commands Without Sharing Server Access Enterprise-\n            grade command delegation platform that transforms how teams manage\n            server operations—secure, auditable, and API-ready\n2.\ntitle       Pricing · GuardCMD\nhref        https://guardcmd.ai/pricing\nbody        Simple, usage-based pricing. Start free with 10,000 checks/month. Starter,\n            Pro, and Pay-as-you-go plans.\n3.\ntitle       OS Command Injection vulnerability affecting Tuleap Enterprise Edition ...\nhref        https://nextguardhq.com/en/vulnerabilities/cve-2026-84285-dassault-systemes-tuleap-enterprise-edition\nbody        An OS Command Injection vulnerability affecting Tuleap Enterprise Edition from\n            17.3 through 17.5 could allow an attacker to execute arbitrary\n            commands on the server.\n4.\ntitle       linux-command-guard - Skywork Skill Hub\nhref        https://skywork.ai/skillhub/linux-command-guard/\nbody        About the linux-command-guard Skill linux-command-guard is a security-focused\n            tool designed to prevent execution of harmful Linux commands,\n            offering layered protection through allowlists, denylists, and\n            more.\n5.\ntitle       Pricing - Securiti\nhref        https://securiti.ai/pricing/\nbody        Get personalized pricing and quotes for Securiti DataAI Command Platform.\n            Discover a tailored solution based on your use cases. Contact us\n            for a custom quote.\n6.\ntitle       Chainguard Pricing\nhref        https://www.chainguard.dev/pricing\nbody        Discover Chainguard's transparent and flexible pricing plans for Zero CVE,\n            Containers. Explore options tailored for enterprises and startups\n            alike.\n=====\n1.\ntitle       ToolGuard — Security Gateway for MCP Servers\nhref        https://toolguard.ai/\nbody        ToolGuard securely connects AI agents to your services — Gmail, GitHub, and\n            more — with credential isolation, policy enforcement, and a full\n            audit log.\n2.\ntitle       Policy-Based MCP Gateway Access: 5 Vendors Compared\nhref        https://netfoundry.io/for-agents/mcp-gateway-vendors-for-policy-based-tool-access/\nbody        There is no single best open-source MCP gateway for every deployment. Open-\n            source components can help with protocol handling and\n            customization, but the team still needs to verify identity\n            binding, policy administration, tool filtering, audit logs, and\n            operational support before selecting one.\n3.\ntitle       GitHub - Blackfrost-AI/agentguard-mcp: Open-source MCP ...\nhref        https://github.com/Blackfrost-AI/agentguard-mcp\nbody        Apr 19, 2026 · AgentGuard MCP is a transparent security gateway that sits\n            between your AI agent and any MCP server. It intercepts every tool\n            call, evaluates it against policy, logs it to a tamper-evident\n            audit chain, and optionally blocks it, all without changing how\n            your agent or your MCP servers are configured.\n4.\ntitle       Obot MCP Gateway - Secure, Open-Source MCP Management\nhref        https://obot.ai/mcp-gateway-platform/\nbody        Obot is an open-source, MCP gateway that manages MCP servers, Skills, access\n            policies, audit, and integrations for AI agents.\n5.\ntitle       Best Open Source MCP Gateways in 2026 - getmaxim.ai\nhref        https://www.getmaxim.ai/articles/best-open-source-mcp-gateways-in-2026/\nbody        Sep 14, 2026 · Six open source MCP gateways worth evaluating in 2026: Bifrost,\n            Docker MCP Gateway, IBM ContextForge, Microsoft MCP Gateway, Obot,\n            and Agentgateway. License matters more than it looks.\n6.\ntitle       GitHub - microsoft/mcp-gateway: MCP Gateway is a reverse ...\nhref        https://github.com/microsoft/mcp-gateway\nbody        MCP Gateway is a reverse proxy and management layer for Model Context Protocol\n            (MCP) servers, enabling scalable, session-aware routing,\n            authorization and lifecycle management of MCP servers in\n            Kubernetes environments.",
